# Baseline for every server, cloud or metal.
# Add your own metapackage here once you have an apt repo, e.g. `mycorp-base`.
PACKAGES install-norec
ca-certificates
curl
gnupg
chrony
vim-tiny
htop
jq
tmux
lsof
bind9-dnsutils
nvme-cli                   # NVMe disks on metal and many clouds (e.g. AWS EBS/instance store)
cloud-init                 # configures every machine on first boot, cloud or metal
systemd-resolved           # DNS from DHCP (systemd-networkd doesn't write resolv.conf)
ifupdown-                  # networking is systemd-networkd, configured by cloud-init (SERVER/30-network)
ssh-import-id              # cloud-init uses it to fetch SSH keys from GitHub (user-data: ssh_import_id)
